                                            // KindleTheForge is on, so the target is left untouched. An existing
                                            // database the drift account owns; SchemaQuench does not create it.
        // "CommandTimeoutSeconds": 0, // How long one deploy command may run. 0 (default) = no limit.
        // "LockTimeoutSeconds": 10, // How long a deploy waits for a lock another session holds before giving up.
                                     // Blank (default) = the engine's own wait, which on SQL Server and PostgreSQL
